{"type":"message","id":"80e47e9e","parentId":"77a79c47","timestamp":"2026-05-28T04:03:55.693Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Thu 2026-05-28 12:03 GMT+8] [Subagent Context] You are running as a subagent (depth 1/1). Results auto-announce to your requester; do not busy-poll for status.\n\n[Subagent Task]: 修改 /root/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/query_news.py 的输出格式，让每条新闻的时间显示得更明确。\n\n当前控制台输出（非 --push 模式）的格式是：\n```\n  1. ⚪ 中性 U.S. CFTC files request...\n     [2026-05-28 09:12] https://...\n```\n\n老公要求\"标注新闻发布时间\"，意思是让每条新闻都明确显示\"发布时间：XXXX-XX-XX HH:MM\"这样的标签，而不是只藏在方括号里。\n\n请修改 `main()` 中控制台输出的部分（非 push 模式），把当前：\n```\n  {i}. {emoji} {title}\n     [{time}] {url}\n```\n改成类似：\n```\n  {i}. {emoji} {title}\n     发布时间：{time} | {url}\n```\n\n同时保持 push_card 模式不变。只改这一处显示格式。改完直接保存即可。"}],"timestamp":1779941035681}}
